{
  "name": "Sales Follow-Up with CRM and RAG",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sales Follow-Up Workflow (CRM + RAG)\n\nThis workflow generates personalized follow-up messages when a deal stage changes in your CRM.\n\n1. Receives a CRM webhook event\n2. Fetches customer history\n3. Queries product docs via RAG\n4. Generates channel-specific messages\n5. Routes to the right channel\n6. Records activity in CRM",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [100, 200],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Set your CRM API credentials**",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 160,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Sticky Note - CRM Creds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [700, 520],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Set your LLM credentials**",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 160,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Sticky Note - LLM Creds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [1300, 520],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Set your channel credentials\n(Email / WhatsApp / Twilio)**",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 200,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Channel Creds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [1900, 520],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "crm-deal-stage-updated",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "DealStageUpdated",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [500, 400],
      "webhookId": "f1a2b3c4-deal-stage-webhook-001",
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.body.crmApiBaseUrl }}/leads/{{ $json.body.leadId }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "include",
              "value": "interactions,products,notes"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-2000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "GetCustomerHistory",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [760, 400],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolDescription": "Use this tool to find relevant product documentation, offers, and price lists for a given customer query or product interest.",
        "options": {
          "topK": 5
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-3000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "ProductDocsRAG",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreInMemory",
      "position": [1400, 600],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-3100-4000-8000-000000000031",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "position": [1200, 600],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-3200-4000-8000-000000000032",
      "name": "Embeddings OpenAI",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOpenAi",
      "position": [1500, 780],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You have the following CRM data about the customer:\n\nLead ID: {{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.leadId }}\nCurrent Stage: {{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.stage }}\nPreferred Channel: {{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.preferredChannel }}\n\nCustomer History:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('GetCustomerHistory').item.json) }}\n\nGenerate personalized follow-up messages for this customer based on the CRM history above and any relevant product documentation you retrieve.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a Sales Follow-Up AI Agent.\nYour goal is to create highly personalized follow-up messages using CRM history and RAG-provided internal documents.\n\nYou MUST always reply with this JSON:\n{\n  \"email_followup\": \"A professional email follow-up message referencing specific products, past interactions, and next steps.\",\n  \"whatsapp_followup\": \"A concise, conversational WhatsApp message with key highlights and a call to action.\",\n  \"sms_followup\": \"A brief SMS (under 160 characters) with a clear call to action.\",\n  \"reasoning_summary\": \"A short explanation of why you chose this approach, what data influenced your message, and which documents were most relevant.\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Reference specific products from the retrieved documents\n- Mention past interactions from the CRM history\n- Adapt tone: formal for email, conversational for WhatsApp, brief for SMS\n- Include concrete next steps or calls to action\n- Never fabricate product details; only use information from retrieved documents"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-4000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "FollowUpWriterAI",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [1100, 400],
      "typeVersion": 1.6
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"email_followup\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"whatsapp_followup\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"sms_followup\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"reasoning_summary\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"email_followup\", \"whatsapp_followup\", \"sms_followup\", \"reasoning_summary\"]\n}"
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-4100-4000-8000-000000000041",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "position": [1300, 780],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-email",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.preferredChannel }}",
              "rightValue": "email",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-5000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Is Email?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [1500, 400],
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.sendgrid.com/v3/mail/send",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "personalizations",
              "value": "=[{\"to\": [{\"email\": \"{{ $('GetCustomerHistory').item.json.email }}\"}]}]"
            },
            {
              "name": "from",
              "value": "={\"email\": \"sales@yourcompany.com\"}"
            },
            {
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "Following up on your inquiry"
            },
            {
              "name": "content",
              "value": "=[{\"type\": \"text/plain\", \"value\": \"{{ $('FollowUpWriterAI').item.json.output.email_followup }}\"}]"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-5100-4000-8000-000000000051",
      "name": "Send Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1800, 300],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-whatsapp",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.preferredChannel }}",
              "rightValue": "whatsapp",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-5200-4000-8000-000000000052",
      "name": "Is WhatsApp?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [1500, 600],
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v17.0/{{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.whatsappPhoneNumberId }}/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"messaging_product\": \"whatsapp\",\n  \"to\": \"{{ $('GetCustomerHistory').item.json.phone }}\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"text\": {\n    \"body\": \"{{ $('FollowUpWriterAI').item.json.output.whatsapp_followup }}\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-5300-4000-8000-000000000053",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1800, 500],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.twilio.com/2010-04-01/Accounts/{{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.twilioAccountSid }}/Messages.json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "To",
              "value": "={{ $('GetCustomerHistory').item.json.phone }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "From",
              "value": "={{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.twilioFromNumber }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Body",
              "value": "={{ $('FollowUpWriterAI').item.json.output.sms_followup }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-5400-4000-8000-000000000054",
      "name": "Send SMS (Twilio)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1800, 700],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.crmApiBaseUrl }}/leads/{{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.leadId }}/activities",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"type\": \"follow_up\",\n  \"channel\": \"{{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.preferredChannel }}\",\n  \"stage\": \"{{ $('DealStageUpdated').item.json.body.stage }}\",\n  \"message_sent\": true,\n  \"reasoning\": \"{{ $('FollowUpWriterAI').item.json.output.reasoning_summary }}\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"{{ new Date().toISOString() }}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-6000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "RecordFollowUpActivity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [2100, 500],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-3300-4000-8000-000000000033",
      "name": "Window Buffer Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "position": [1100, 600],
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
